{"id":"75be5f3bdd0be0c7","group":"92","path":"92/92-cor-consistency-independent.md","title":"Consistency Statement Independent","display":"cor-consistency-independent — Consistency Statement Independent","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-cor-consistency-independent","aliases":["92-cor-consistency-independent"],"display":"cor-consistency-independent — Consistency Statement Independent","depends_on":["[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-sound-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-cor-consistency-independent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-cor-consistency-independent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-consistency-independent — Consistency Statement Independent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57ea3ea286817df3\" href=\"?note=57ea3ea286817df3\" title=\"92-thm-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-second-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (internal consistency sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic soundness, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}independent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}independent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> : 对象语言中的一致性句</li>\n<li>第二不完备性在外部相容性下给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>排除<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>需要更强条件；这里用算术可靠性，因为单纯相容的有效理论可以错误地证明自身不相容</li>\n<li>在本推论的可靠性假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>是与Gödel句子类似的独立句</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"57ea3ea286817df3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ (internal consistency sentence, see [[92-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (arithmetic soundness, see [[92-df-sound-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}independent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\land G\\nvdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false}],"bytes":1206,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-cor-consistency-independent]]"}],"outgoing":["68f172d58c15e75d","57ea3ea286817df3","c7befd96bd551ade","d76d3a84b374975c"]}